WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.448
It was a gloomy day at the palace.

2
00:00:11.449 --> 00:00:14.846
The king yawned and rubbed his eyes.

3
00:00:14.847 --> 00:00:19.203
"I didn't sleep at all last night," he moaned.

4
00:00:19.204 --> 00:00:22.142
The king put his head in his hands.

5
00:00:22.143 --> 00:00:24.923
"I don't know what to do."

6
00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:27.269
The queen shook her head.

7
00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:30.845
"This must stop," she said.

8
00:00:30.846 --> 00:00:36.459
"I need my beauty sleep!"

9
00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:39.411
That night the king went to bed.

10
00:00:39.412 --> 00:00:42.315
A servant brought him a soft pillow.

11
00:00:42.316 --> 00:01:00.441
Cook brought him some warm milk.

12
00:01:00.442 --> 00:01:06.286
But the king tossed and turned again.

13
00:01:06.287 --> 00:01:08.557
The queen tried singing.

14
00:01:08.558 --> 00:01:13.786
"Go to sleep, my king!" she shrieked.

15
00:01:13.787 --> 00:01:18.301
He covered his ears with the soft pillow.

16
00:01:18.302 --> 00:01:26.175
Now he had a royal headache!

17
00:01:26.176 --> 00:01:29.547
The next morning the king stomped his foot.

18
00:01:29.548 --> 00:01:32.179
"Ouch!" cried the queen.

19
00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:35.322
"You stomped on my toes!"

20
00:01:35.323 --> 00:01:38.243
"Sorry," said the king.

21
00:01:38.244 --> 00:01:40.368
He rubbed his eyes.

22
00:01:40.369 --> 00:01:44.483
"I'm not getting any sleep!" he moaned.

23
00:01:44.484 --> 00:01:47.865
The queen rubbed her sore toes.

24
00:01:47.866 --> 00:01:52.525
"This must stop," she said.

25
00:01:52.526 --> 00:01:55.709
Then the queen snapped her fingers.

26
00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:57.997
"I know what to do!"

27
00:01:57.998 --> 00:02:03.755
"Please! Don't sing again!" the king begged.

28
00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:06.240
The queen glared at him.

29
00:02:06.241 --> 00:02:09.882
"Here's what we'll do," she said.

30
00:02:09.883 --> 00:02:12.407
She whispered in his ear.

31
00:02:12.408 --> 00:02:14.541
The king nodded.

32
00:02:14.542 --> 00:02:18.823
"All will be well now!" the queen said.

33
00:02:18.824 --> 00:02:21.757
But all was not well.

34
00:02:21.758 --> 00:02:27.432
Someone was listening.

